  "identity_note": "Source-bound grant/epoch IDs already differ before economic decisions; compare actual controls separately without altering stored originals.",
  "finding": "H1 first changes the Jan17 2024 sz300394 exit. By May2025 its actual account risk budget clears one session earlier and locks recovery members on May8 instead of May9. sh688146 ret120 on May8 is -0.14667031064953995, failing the then -0.15 depth requirement; May9 is -0.1724599328000952 and the held-anchor recent-breakout route can use May8 evidence. Thus absence is timing/qualification and subsequent cohort ownership, not a rejected sh688146 order due to cash or execution. The intervening account-dependent capital-budget difference is observed; no claim that one stock counterfactual proves portfolio benefit."
